528	
529	```bash
530	# View recent fuzzy search logs
531	npm run logs:view -- --count 20
532	
533	# Analyze patterns and performance
534	npm run logs:analyze -- --threshold 0.8
535	
536	# Export logs to CSV or JSON
537	npm run logs:export -- --format json --output analysis.json
538	
539	# Clear all logs (with confirmation)
540	npm run logs:clear
541	```
