1	# Spark MCP (Model Context Protocol) Optimizer
2	
3	This project implements a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server and client for optimizing Apache Spark code. The system provides intelligent code optimization suggestions and performance analysis through a client-server architecture.
4	
5	## How It Works
6	
7	### Code Optimization Workflow
8	
9	```mermaid
10	graph TB
11	    subgraph Input
12	        A[Input PySpark Code] --> |spark_code_input.py| B[run_client.py]
13	    end
14	
