16	        B --> |Async HTTP| C[SparkMCPClient]
17	        C --> |Protocol Handler| D[Tools Interface]
18	    end
19	
20	    subgraph MCP Server
21	        E[run_server.py] --> F[SparkMCPServer]
22	        F --> |Tool Registry| G[optimize_spark_code]
23	        F --> |Tool Registry| H[analyze_performance]
24	        F --> |Protocol Handler| I[Claude AI Integration]
25	    end
26	
27	    subgraph Resources
28	        I --> |Code Analysis| J[Claude AI Model]
29	        J --> |Optimization| K[Optimized Code Generation]
30	        K --> |Validation| L[PySpark Runtime]
31	    end
32	
33	    subgraph Output
