200	### Quick Start
201	
202	1. Add your Spark code to optimize in `input/spark_code_input.py`
203	
204	2. Start the MCP server:
205	```bash
206	python v1/run_server.py
207	```
208	
209	3. Run the client to optimize your code:
210	```bash
211	python v1/run_client.py
212	```
