214	This will generate two files:
215	- `output/optimized_spark_example.py`: The optimized Spark code with detailed optimization comments
216	- `output/performance_analysis.md`: Comprehensive performance analysis
217	
218	4. Run and compare code versions:
219	```bash
220	python v1/run_optimized.py
221	```
222	
223	This will:
224	- Execute both original and optimized code
225	- Compare execution times and results
226	- Update the performance analysis with execution metrics
227	- Show detailed performance improvement statistics
